#. y1:english="What's the matter?\nWell, I'm the owner of this cafe here...{PA:20}||and we've been having a problem...\nSomeone has been spray painting the store||front and every time I erase it,\nthe bastards just spray paint it again...\nI wonder if there is any way to prevent it||from happening...\n{SP:1}.................{MR:00}\nI got an idea!{PA:20}\nWhy don't you stand out here for a while||and keep an eye on it?\nYou look tough, maybe you'll scare them off.\nI bet you can catch the guys||that have been writing this graffiti.{PA:20}\nYou'll be rewarded of course.{PA:20}||So, how about it?\nAccept the assignment?\nNo,{PA:10} I won't do it.\nOh, really...{PA:10}||Come back if you change your mind...\nOkay.\nThen stand guard right here.\n"
