#. y1:english="Kano, {PA:10}you came...\nUmm, {PA:10}yes...\n...So, {PA:10}you must be Kazuma Kiryu.\nWhat? {PA:10}How do you know my name?\nHumph... {PA:10}I guess there are gangsters||with consciences after all.\nWhat do you mean?\nWell done, {PA:10}Kano.{PA:20}||You can go now.\nI'm sorry, {PA:10}Aniki!\nI... {PA:10}I had no choice but to do this...{PA:20}||I'm really sorry!\nYou're the one that's committed suicide||by coming here, {PA:20}Kazuma Kiryu.\nPrepare to die.\nAniki, please forgive me!!{PA:10}||This isn't personal!\n"
