#. y1:english="Are you motivated now?{PA:20}||This is a great opportunity. {PA:10}Trust me.\nTell me what the deal is.\nThere's a fancy pub up the street there...\nThey don't seem to be paying any money||out to any families around here.\nSo, {PA:10}we run up in there||and demand that they pay us every month.\nIt's a first-come, first-served basis in||this world, yeah? {PA:20}Let's do this, Aniki!\n\nNo. I refuse.\nHuh? {PA:10}Aniki! {PA:10}This is||a business opportunity... Don't you get it?\n"
